## 2. Constants - No Magic Numbers

### ❌ WRONG

```typescript
if (percentage > 90) { ... }
if (size > 5000000000) { ... }
const timeout = 5000;
const requestId = Date.now().toString(36);
```

### ✅ CORRECT

```typescript
import {
  COST_CAP_THRESHOLDS,
  TIMEOUTS,
  generateRequestId
} from '../shared/constants';

if (percentage > COST_CAP_THRESHOLDS.WARNING_PERCENTAGE) { ... }
if (size > COST_CAP_THRESHOLDS.D1_SIZE_LIMIT) { ... }
const timeout = TIMEOUTS.DATABASE_QUERY;
const requestId = generateRequestId();
```

### Rule: All Configuration in Constants

**File:** `src/shared/constants.ts`

**Categories:**
- `TEST_LIMITS` - Test bypass values
- `COST_CAP_THRESHOLDS` - Cost cap percentages & limits
- `RATE_LIMITS` - Rate limiting configuration
- `TIMEOUTS` - All timeout values
- `RETRY_CONFIG` - Retry logic settings
- `TTL` - Time-to-live settings
- `STEAM_THRESHOLDS` - Steam detection thresholds
- `SHARP_SCORE_THRESHOLDS` - Sharp score classifications
- `ANOMALY_DETECTION` - Anomaly detection config
- `PAGINATION` - Pagination defaults
- `REQUEST_ID` - Request ID generation config
- `HTTP_STATUS` - HTTP status codes

