### Checklist for New Code

- [ ] No `as any` type assertions
- [ ] No `console.log/error` (use StructuredLogger)
- [ ] No magic numbers (use constants from `shared/constants.ts`)
- [ ] No duplicate code (use utilities from `utils/request.ts`)
- [ ] All errors handled explicitly (no empty catch)
- [ ] Request ID generated with `generateRequestId()`
- [ ] D1 results normalized with `normalizeD1Result()`
- [ ] CORS headers from `CORS_HEADERS` constant
- [ ] Database queries use `DatabaseHelper` with timeout
- [ ] All functions have JSDoc comments
- [ ] All code has ≥80% test coverage

